#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Parameters to set when provisioning a Qiskit Runtime service instance, and "
"extension fields returned when accessing an instance."
msgstr ""
"Parameter yang perlu diatur saat menyediakan instans layanan Qiskit Runtime,"
" dan kolom ekstensi yang dikembalikan saat mengakses suatu instans."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use IBM Cloud Platform APIs to access instances"
msgstr "Gunakan IBM Cloud Platform APIs untuk mengakses instans"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore ResourceController  */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore ResourceController  */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use IBM Cloud Platform APIs to access instances {#use-ibm-cloud-platform-"
"apis-to-access-instances}"
msgstr ""
"Gunakan IBM Cloud Platform APIs untuk mengakses instans {#use-ibm-cloud-"
"platform-apis-to-access-instances}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This guide is for anyone using the IBM Cloud Platform APIs to provision, "
"update, or manage access to instances. It provides details on the "
"[parameters](#parameters) you can set when provisioning an instance, as well"
" as the set of [extension fields](#extensions) returned when you access an "
"instance.\n"
msgstr ""
"Panduan ini ditujukan bagi siapa saja yang menggunakan IBM Cloud Platform "
"APIs untuk menyediakan, memperbarui, atau mengelola akses ke instans. "
"Panduan ini memberikan detail tentang [parameter](#parameters) yang bisa "
"kamu atur saat menyediakan instans, serta kumpulan [kolom "
"ekstensi](#extensions) yang dikembalikan saat kamu mengakses suatu "
"instans.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Refer to the IBM Cloud&reg; ResourceController API documentation for more information.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Lihat dokumentasi IBM Cloud&reg; ResourceController API untuk informasi lebih lanjut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Some relevant pages:\n"
"- [Create (provision) a new resource instance](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#create-resource-instance)\n"
"- [Update a resource instance](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#update-resource-instance)\n"
"- [Get a resource instance](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#get-resource-instance)\n"
"- [Get a list of all resource instances](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#list-resource-instances)  \n"
msgstr ""
"Beberapa halaman yang relevan:\n"
"- [Buat (sediakan) instans resource baru](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#create-resource-instance)\n"
"- [Perbarui instans resource](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#update-resource-instance)\n"
"- [Dapatkan instans resource](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#get-resource-instance)\n"
"- [Dapatkan daftar semua instans resource](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#list-resource-instances)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When getting a list of all resource instances, note that you can filter to "
"only Qiskit Runtime instances with `resource_id = "
"\"b6049020-80f4-11eb-a0f7-e35ec9b4054f\"`\n"
msgstr ""
"    Saat mendapatkan daftar semua instans resource, perlu diketahui bahwa "
"kamu bisa memfilter hanya instans Qiskit Runtime dengan `resource_id = "
"\"b6049020-80f4-11eb-a0f7-e35ec9b4054f\"`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "</Admonition>\n"
msgstr "</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "`parameters` {#parameters}"
msgstr "`parameters` {#parameters}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "In the body when provisioning or updating an instance:\n"
msgstr "Dalam body saat menyediakan atau memperbarui instans:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- **instance_limit_seconds** (string or null, `^[0-9]+$`): The limit to set on the instance. For Open Plan: if omitted, this defaults to 10 minutes.\n"
".\n"
"- **usage_allocation_seconds** (string or null, `^[0-9]+$`): Allotted time for the instance, used by the fair-share scheduler to determine the priority in the queue, based on usage of all QPUs. (This does not apply to Pay-As-You-Go instances.)\n"
"- **backends** (array of lists of backends (strings or null) or array with \"ANY\"): the allow-list of names of backends that are available to this instance. Default: `[\"ANY\"]`, means all backends available on this plan. `[]` means no backends.\n"
msgstr ""
"- **instance_limit_seconds** (string atau null, `^[0-9]+$`): Batas yang ditetapkan pada instans. Untuk Open Plan: jika dihilangkan, nilai defaultnya adalah 10 menit.\n"
".\n"
"- **usage_allocation_seconds** (string atau null, `^[0-9]+$`): Waktu yang dialokasikan untuk instans, digunakan oleh penjadwal fair-share untuk menentukan prioritas dalam antrean, berdasarkan penggunaan semua QPU. (Ini tidak berlaku untuk instans Pay-As-You-Go.)\n"
"- **backends** (array berisi daftar backend (string atau null) atau array dengan \"ANY\"): daftar izin nama Backend yang tersedia untuk instans ini. Default: `[\"ANY\"]`, artinya semua Backend tersedia di paket ini. `[]` berarti tidak ada Backend.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "`extensions` {#extensions}"
msgstr "`extensions` {#extensions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In the response when provisioning or when getting the details of an "
"instance:\n"
msgstr ""
"Dalam respons saat menyediakan atau saat mendapatkan detail suatu instans:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Additional instance properties contributed by the service that are "
"represented as key-value pairs. These properties persist with the instance "
"under the extensions property.\n"
msgstr ""
"Properti instans tambahan yang disumbangkan oleh layanan dan "
"direpresentasikan sebagai pasangan kunci-nilai. Properti ini tetap ada "
"bersama instans di bawah properti extensions.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**instance_limit_seconds** (integer or null, `>= 0`): The time limit to set "
"on the instance.\n"
msgstr ""
"**instance_limit_seconds** (integer atau null, `>= 0`): Batas waktu yang "
"ditetapkan pada instans.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**usage_allocation_seconds** (integer or null, `>= 0`): Allotted time for "
"the instance, used by the fair-share scheduler to determine the priority in "
"the queue, based on usage of all QPUs.\n"
msgstr ""
"**usage_allocation_seconds** (integer atau null, `>= 0`): Waktu yang "
"dialokasikan untuk instans, digunakan oleh penjadwal fair-share untuk "
"menentukan prioritas dalam antrean, berdasarkan penggunaan semua QPU.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**backends** (Required; array of lists of backends (strings) or array with "
"\"ANY\" (strings)): The allow-list of names of backends that are available "
"to this instance. Default: `[\"ANY\"]`, means all backends are available on "
"this plan. `[]` means no backends.\n"
msgstr ""
"**backends** (Wajib; array berisi daftar backend (string) atau array dengan "
"\"ANY\" (string)): Daftar izin nama Backend yang tersedia untuk instans ini."
" Default: `[\"ANY\"]`, artinya semua Backend tersedia di paket ini. `[]` "
"berarti tidak ada Backend.\n"
